 ## Tests
 
     java tools/RunTests.java
 
 The runner compiles `src/main/java` and `src/test/java` and runs every JUnit 5 test. It needs
 `lib/junit-platform-console-standalone.jar`.
+
+## Invalid configuration
+
+Startup is strict. If the file is missing or unreadable, contains an unknown key, or any value is invalid
+(non-numeric, out of range, malformed URL or timeout, ...), the relay prints every problem to standard error and
+exits with status 78 without processing any input. Defaults apply only to keys that are absent.
